lines+=['','Maximum absolute full-prefix metric-identity closure across all6 cells is3.873e-121 at120dps. This is a numerical agreement check, not an outward enclosure.', '', 'The CSV also separates the positive4(ReF)² and negative−4(ImF)² pieces. The full-prefix identity K=2G_positive−4M_im is independently checked, where M_im counts imaginary squares over both positive-height reflected nodes; nu remains the multiplicity symbol. The `unpaid` difference must not be folded into either term or called a certified tail.','','## Replay and provenance','','Run `python3 dh_extended.py` then `python3 summarize_dh.py` (mpmath). Evaluation uses 120 dps, the unchanged physical coefficients and the extended310 census. `dh_extended_provenance.json` records every input hash; `dh_extended.csv` and `dh_extended_quartets.csv` retain full precision and every cutoff classification. No zero census, source minimum, residual, cofinal law or RH claim is certified here.']
